From 77f300180a837e590ca036bf348ab6711d31a4c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:45:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Fix: a water move soaks her even when it has effects of
 its own (status_effects.from_move_type_always); a burn stays on the spot the
 fire touched; a grab with no named part takes the part and grip its words
 name (round the hind legs, with her twin tails); a direction claiming a grip
 that is gone (legs tied) is dropped

---
 director.py | 51 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 engine.py   | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++--------
 narrator.py |  8 ++++++++
 rules.json  |  2 ++
 4 files changed, 80 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

